# The samples CREATE their schema at startup - IdentityServer migrates and seeds, WebApi runs its
# initializer, WebApiEF issues CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS - so a database file here is the output of
# having run one, never an input to running it. Twenty-eight of them were committed, 624 KB,
# including the IdentityServer one carrying its seeded administrator.
#
# Deliberately scoped to this directory. A repository-wide `*.witdb` rule would also exclude
# Sources/Providers/OutWit.Database.AdoNet.Tests/Fixtures, where a database written by an older
# version IS the input and has to be committed.

*.witdb
*.witdb-wal
*.witdb.lock
*.lock
*_indexes/
